<title>USA: Raymond James Q2 March 27 net rises.</title>
<headline>Raymond James Q2 March 27 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary	   $   1.18		   $ 0.49</p>
<p> Net			 38,130		   15,313</p>
<p> Revs		     249,995		  178,719</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	32,273		   31,545</p>
<p>		     6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary	    $  1.72		   $ 0.89</p>
<p> Net			 55,298		   27,854</p>
<p> Revs		     444,814		  330,745</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	32,064		   31,441</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 and six-months net includes one-time gain of $30.6 million on January 1997 sale of interest in Liberty Investment Management.</p>
<p>Excluding gain, 1997 Q1 net income was $19.3 million or $0.60 per share. Excluding gain, 1997 six-months net income was $36.5 million or $1.14 per share.</p>
<p>Full Name is Raymond James Financial Inc.</p>
